<section class="section" id="advocate">
  <div class="section__inner reveal">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div class="section__kicker"><span class="label">I · The Office</span></div>
      <h2 class="section__title">The Public <em>Advocate</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="advocate">
      <div class="bars" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div>
        <div class="advocate__name">{{ site.advocate }}<span>Public Advocate of the {{ site.party }}</span></div>
        <div class="advocate__who">{{ site.city }}</div>
        <blockquote class="advocate__quote">
          It is hereby declared that the spiritual unity of the organs of the State with the People, and the public morality of the Capital, are essential to public order and to the Imperial authority.
          <cite>Mandate on Culture, section 2 — {{ site.mandateDate }}</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
      <div class="advocate__text">
        <p>Section six of the New York Home Rule Act commits to the Public Advocate the supervision of all that the people hear, read, are taught and behold. Unity and morality are formed in the newspaper and the broadcast, the stage and the song, the classroom and the sermon, the club and the assembly. Their supervision is the Advocate's charge.</p>
        <p>The Department of Culture is the instrument by which that charge is exercised. It is an investigative body: it watches, gathers, records and refers. Every finding reaches the Advocate clean, confidential and inside the law. Every question of what the Doctrine means is answered by the Advocate alone.</p>
        <p>The Department holds no power of arrest, search or seizure. It does not need them. The Office has them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper2" id="department">
  <div class="section__inner reveal">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div class="section__kicker"><span class="label">II · The Department</span></div>
      <h2 class="section__title">Four desks.<br>One <em>Collection.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="desks">
      <article class="desk">
        <div class="desk__num">1</div>
        <h3 class="desk__title">Print and Broadcast</h3>
        <p>Newspapers, books, leaflets, radio, television and film. Every issue, every reel, submitted before release and answered within a day.</p>
        <div class="desk__foot">Mandate s.6 · Prior review</div>
      </article>
      <article class="desk">
        <div class="desk__num">2</div>
        <h3 class="desk__title">Stage, Music and Societies</h3>
        <p>Theatres, clubs, music halls, choirs, Turnvereine, social clubs and veterans' halls. Curators attend performances and meetings, declared or not.</p>
        <div class="desk__foot">Mandate s.7 · Observation</div>
      </article>
      <article class="desk">
        <div class="desk__num">3</div>
        <h3 class="desk__title">Schools and Instruction</h3>
        <p>Classrooms, lectures, textbooks and sermons. Curricula still carrying the names of the Republic are reviewed under the Public Names Order.</p>
        <div class="desk__foot">Public Names Order</div>
      </article>
      <article class="desk">
        <div class="desk__num">4</div>
        <h3 class="desk__title">Public Bodies and Observances</h3>
        <p>Conduct and speech inside offices, Council, precincts and commands; the Days and every Party observance, attended and recorded.</p>
        <div class="desk__foot">Seditious Terminology Mandate art. V</div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="posters">
  <div class="section__inner reveal">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div class="section__kicker"><span class="label">III · Public Notices</span></div>
      <h2 class="section__title">Posted in the <em>Capital</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="posters">

      <article class="poster poster--red" style="--tilt:-1.2deg">
        <div class="poster__art on-red">
          {% set id = "p1" %}{% set class = "poster__eye" %}{% include "partials/emblem.njk" %}{% set class = "" %}
        </div>
        <div class="poster__kicker">The Collection · Mandate s.7</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="poster__title">The eye sees.<br>The eye records.</h3>
          <p class="poster__line">Nothing public escapes notice. Nothing noticed is forgotten.</p>
          <div class="poster__cite">Department of Culture · Office of the Public Advocate</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="poster" style="--tilt:.8deg">
        <div class="poster__art">
          <div class="poster__bars"><div class="bars"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="poster__kicker" style="margin-left:90px">Prior review · Mandate s.6</div>
        <div style="margin-left:90px">
          <h3 class="poster__title">Submit<br>before<br>release.</h3>
          <p class="poster__line">Every page. Every reel. Every stage. Every lesson.</p>
          <div class="poster__cite">Permit · Permit with alterations · Withhold</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="poster poster--ink" style="--tilt:-.6deg">
        <div class="poster__kicker">Seditious Terminology Mandate · Art. V</div>
        <div class="poster__clock">2<small>Hours</small></div>
        <div>
          <p class="poster__line">A seditious word heard is a seditious word reported.</p>
          <div class="poster__cite">Every public servant · Every office · No exception</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="poster" style="--tilt:1.4deg">
        <div class="poster__img-wrap"><img class="poster__img" src="/assets/img/third-work-cover.webp" alt="Cover of The Third Work, approved by the Office of the Public Advocate" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="poster__shade"></div>
        <div class="poster__kicker" style="position:relative;color:var(--paper)">Doctrine · Book Two, Part Ten</div>
        <div style="position:relative;color:var(--paper)">
          <h3 class="poster__title poster__title--stencil">Read.<br>Keep.<br>Submit.</h3>
          <div class="poster__cite">The Third Work · Approved</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="poster" style="--tilt:-1deg">
        <div class="poster__img-wrap"><img class="poster__img" src="/assets/img/proclamation-poster.webp" alt="Proclamation poster: the Spiritual Penal Code is in force in the Capital of the Protectorate" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="poster__shade"></div>
        <div></div>
        <div style="position:relative;color:var(--paper)">
          <h3 class="poster__title">Transgression.<br>Atonement.</h3>
          <p class="poster__line">The Spiritual Penal Code is in force in the Capital.</p>
          <div class="poster__cite">Office of the Public Advocate</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="poster poster--red" style="--tilt:.5deg">
        <div class="poster__tiles on-red" aria-hidden="true">
          {% for i in range(0, 12) %}{% set id = "t" + i %}{% set class = "" %}{% include "partials/emblem.njk" %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="poster__kicker">The Collection · Mandate s.7</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="poster__title">An entry is not an accusation.</h3>
          <p class="poster__line">The Collection records. The Advocate decides.</p>
          <div class="poster__cite">Department of Culture</div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

