      <figure class="proc-figure">
        <img src="/assets/img/mandate-proclamation-page.png" alt="First page of the Proclamation concerning the Mandate of the Department of Culture, issued in New York City on the 10th of October, 1962" loading="lazy">
        <div class="stamp stamp--lg" style="--em-red:var(--paper)">Approved<small>Office of the Public Advocate</small></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="duty">
  <div class="section__inner reveal">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div class="section__kicker"><span class="label">V · Your Duty</span></div>
      <h2 class="section__title">Heard it?<br>You have <em>two hours.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="duty">
      <div class="duty__clock">2<span>Hours · Art. V</span></div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:1.25rem">Under Article V of the Seditious Terminology Mandate, every public servant of the Capital who hears a seditious word, insult or slur reports it to the Department of Culture within two hours. The Department is the intake for the whole city.</p>
        <ol class="duty__steps">
          <li><div><b>Note it.</b> The time, the place, the words as spoken, who spoke them and who else heard.</div></li>
          <li><div><b>Report it.</b> To the Department within two hours, by the channel your office has been given, or in writing.</div></li>
          <li><div><b>Say nothing.</b> Do not confront the speaker, and never tell anyone they are under review. The Department never warns; neither do you.</div></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="duty__box">
          <div class="label">Written reports</div>
          <div class="typewriter">Department of Culture<br>{{ site.box }}<br>{{ site.city }}</div>
        </div>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:22px;font-size:1rem">A good-faith report carries no penalty. A false report, or one made to settle a score, is a Title 70 matter.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ink" id="thirdwork">
  <div class="section__inner reveal">
    <div class="work">
      <img class="work__cover" src="/assets/img/third-work-cover.webp" alt="The Third Work" loading="lazy">
      <div>
        <div class="section__kicker"><span class="label" style="color:var(--paper)">VI · Doctrine</span></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">The Third Work<br><em>Book Two, Part Ten</em></h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:22px">What every servant of the Capital owes the Department:</p>
        <ul class="work__list">
          <li><b>I</b><span>Submit material before release.</span></li>
          <li><b>II</b><span>Give Curators access wherever they present themselves.</span></li>
          <li><b>III</b><span>Withdraw a withheld work everywhere: shelves, programmes, curricula, catalogues.</span></li>
          <li><b>IV</b><span>Never warn anyone under review.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
